SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia\, Avlakia
LOCATION:Avlakia\, Pserimos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Pserimos\, the 30-person islet between Kos and Kalymnos\, has its one big day on 15 August: caiques from Kalymnos and Kos bring hundreds for the liturgy at the Panagia church at Avlakia\, then traditional music\, dancing and local food on the beach front. The excursion boats go back in the afternoon\, so if you want the evening\, arrange a room or a return caique in advance.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/pserimos/#avlakia-panigiri-of-panagia-avlakia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/pserimos/#avlakia-panigiri-of-panagia-avlakia
END:VEVENT
